      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3 Reference Prompter test (no image)\n\nThe prompter reads the portrait, the costume and each pose with a local vision model and rewrites the short prompt into a long H3 prompt. The short prompt is kept word for word at the start; the model adds the detail after it. Roles are `auto`.\n\n**Nude** (18+ mode): the costume picture is a blank placeholder and the prompter describes the unclothed adult body. It refuses unless the portrait's estimated age is 20 or older. Never use an uploaded photo of a real person.\n\nThe three Display Text nodes show the short prompt, the H3 prompt and what the model saw.\n\n### Character hint\n\nThe **Character Hint (Female)** node feeds the prompter's `character_hint` input. Its traits win over the portrait: here it asks for green eyes, a copper bob with curtain bangs, soft glam makeup and a few freckles. Set every field back to `-` (or disconnect it) to follow the portrait only. The hint text is shown in the \"Character hint\" box."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## H3 Reference Prompter test (no image)\n\nThe prompter reads the portrait, the costume and each pose with a local vision model and rewrites the short prompt into a long H3 prompt. The short prompt is kept word for word at the start; the model adds the detail after it. Roles are `auto`.\n\n**Nude** (18+ mode): the costume picture is a blank placeholder and the prompter describes the unclothed adult body. It refuses unless the portrait's estimated age is 20 or older. Never use an uploaded photo of a real person.\n\nThe three Display Text nodes show the short prompt, the H3 prompt and what the model saw.\n\n### Character hint\n\nThe **Character Hint (Female)** node feeds the prompter's `character_hint` input. Its traits win over the portrait: here it asks for green eyes, a copper bob with curtain bangs, soft glam makeup and a few freckles. Set every field back to `-` (or disconnect it) to follow the portrait only. The hint text is shown in the \"Character hint\" box."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
